{"id": "official:sentence:79343b84-7f60-4fdb-94a7-502c2074b618", "text": "我不认为这正在发生。", "shortMeaning": "我看这事现在没在发生。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:22a38d30-80c3-44ba-a148-60a5bee8d3b5", "text": "我不认为那可以变得更糟。", "shortMeaning": "我看那不会再更坏了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:16a17ece-7e3c-4f49-aeae-1bddd27fb019", "text": "我不认为那部电影有趣。", "shortMeaning": "我看那电影没意思。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:7abb6982-d981-47f1-979a-94889dcfbb18", "text": "我不认识任何一个盲人。", "shortMeaning": "我一个盲人也不认得。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:458d8266-bf3c-46bb-a92e-ad0b4157a1fc", "text": "我不认识她，也不想认识。", "shortMeaning": "我不认得她，也不想认得。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:ee567633-a790-451d-a727-66525fc9d3ec", "text": "我不认识符合条件的人。", "shortMeaning": "符合条件的人我不认识。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:688892b2-8454-4ac2-ac9c-93da64d6d0ab", "text": "我不记得上次看到她微笑。", "shortMeaning": "上回见她笑是什么时候，我记不得了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:967db877-a464-47fc-baa7-bb11a27ffdb4", "text": "我不记得事故的情况。", "shortMeaning": "事故怎么出的，我记不清了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:a0842023-7e7e-4ace-ae04-d179bac552e6", "text": "我不记得他什么时候搬去波士顿了。", "shortMeaning": "他哪时搬到波士顿，我记不住了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:efbdc3bc-9f86-4ff8-82f6-594ff71822ed", "text": "我不记得你的名字了。", "shortMeaning": "你的名字我想不起来了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:f042bbd3-96ca-49b9-a5e4-64bfdcbe5d1e", "text": "我不记得干了那样的事情。", "shortMeaning": "我记不得自己干过那种事。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:69b1898e-2b3a-4803-b319-c59b58422778", "text": "我不记得我把钥匙放在哪儿了。", "shortMeaning": "钥匙放哪儿了，我想不起来了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:7344bf74-0b3c-4abf-96d3-8cac85db17e0", "text": "我不记得曾经见过她。", "shortMeaning": "我记不得见过她。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:792d56f7-24ab-47b5-a591-54b20ac0acb3", "text": "我不该把一整包薯片都吃完的。", "shortMeaning": "一整包薯片我不该全吃光。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:e6d0c80c-1525-4b86-96d2-8a43eaf994ba", "text": "我不该把我的房子卖了的。", "shortMeaning": "我那房子本不该卖。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:83ab5ad8-fe7f-4889-9832-88847ec239bc", "text": "我不跟他讲这件事。", "shortMeaning": "这事我不跟他说。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:03135bcd-86d1-4ac5-89d7-ede79afa4996", "text": "我不跟你这样的人做生意。", "shortMeaning": "我不跟你这种人做买卖。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:0f158698-7329-4a75-afb6-10ed70a82c34", "text": "我不需要任何帮助。", "shortMeaning": "我什么帮忙都不需要。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:fbc63c97-6208-4fe8-8872-004251e0614f", "text": "我不需要你或别的人。", "shortMeaning": "你也不用，别人也不用。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:6f2e7560-df82-460a-8ae1-259ef9ece0ba", "text": "我不需要你的同情。", "shortMeaning": "你的可怜我用不着。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:3edeb3d1-b95b-420e-b549-94814fc5a526", "text": "我不饿，但我总想吃东西。", "shortMeaning": "我不饿，可总想往嘴里塞点东西。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:17674d44-99cd-450b-88a8-6d9c0f8df232", "text": "我与你的表亲相处甚好。", "shortMeaning": "我跟你的表亲处得挺好。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:eeb0750c-4215-408d-b340-b05fad9de674", "text": "我与这起犯罪没有任何关系。", "shortMeaning": "这桩案子跟我半点关系没有。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:963f65e4-1788-4985-83c2-347d514349e8", "text": "我丢了我的一个文件夹。", "shortMeaning": "我丢了一个文件夹。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:30726ee6-04f4-43db-b9e0-747d707a7f99", "text": "我两个礼拜就会回来。", "shortMeaning": "我两星期就回来。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:6a89cd28-bb93-4b7d-940f-131c99c3ae17", "text": "我两个脸颊都被打了。", "shortMeaning": "我两边脸都挨了打。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:1d0d4c18-2f4c-4b31-aa09-7b76773ff669", "text": "我两年前读过这本书。", "shortMeaning": "两年前我读过这本书。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:41c97495-d60f-4821-825d-b690f01e1aab", "text": "我两点半之前需要得知。", "shortMeaning": "两点半以前我得知道。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:95469bd5-5016-4ac1-a70c-05883d5f67c1", "text": "我中午十二点半还要去浦东。", "shortMeaning": "中午十二点半我还得去浦东。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:7f5ad965-58ba-4e04-811c-db7c5fd34146", "text": "我为了停车计时收费器需要它。", "shortMeaning": "我要它来付停车计费表。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:3f38c859-c590-4e5c-965d-d0a7b060718b", "text": "我为什么一定要知道呢？", "shortMeaning": "我干嘛非得知道不可？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:76e34cb0-76e9-4535-9142-4675c87bfc3e", "text": "我为什么一定要那么做？", "shortMeaning": "我干嘛非那样做不可？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:25f5cf99-b64e-4f66-8dcc-b5b109aa6eca", "text": "我为什么不给你打电话？", "shortMeaning": "我怎么不给你打电话呢？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:0897cd22-7430-4006-95bb-44970e2abf93", "text": "我为什么找不到你？", "shortMeaning": "我怎么就找不到你？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:f690c92f-67c4-434b-bd0f-9aaf2b734ea4", "text": "我为什么要洗碗呢？", "shortMeaning": "凭什么要我去洗碗？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:f489a792-9be3-4f69-a6e9-3d9da14a05a5", "text": "我为什么要用怀疑的方式提出在我看来一点也不怀疑的事情呢？", "shortMeaning": "我看来毫不怀疑的事，何必用怀疑的口气说呢？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:f09eb14e-a193-4506-8345-498b09d1855d", "text": "我为什么要给他钱？", "shortMeaning": "我凭什么给他钱？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:b5ae85ef-3232-4f2d-8f75-cc04d80dff66", "text": "我为他傲慢自大对他发火。", "shortMeaning": "他自大，我冲他发了火。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:6bcc9879-5f37-4e85-98a1-8172a24920cf", "text": "我为他打了10年的工。", "shortMeaning": "我给他干了十年活。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:fe056c9a-3491-414e-a626-f6c3ef662889", "text": "我为他的优柔寡断而焦虑。", "shortMeaning": "他拿不定主意，我替他着急。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:11343340-c296-4757-a4ae-bbaa27cd139b", "text": "我为你保存这些东西。", "shortMeaning": "这些东西我替你留着。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:d2b2b637-9470-429d-96d4-2aa0341644a4", "text": "我为你的卑鄙行径感到羞耻。", "shortMeaning": "你干的那样下作，我脸上无光。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:3486f8a6-e16f-4e34-b279-3a53a7eb59dd", "text": "我为你的行为感到可耻。", "shortMeaning": "你做的事让我觉得丢人。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:7ab57fec-17d7-4eb8-8dd8-3c5f57aff17a", "text": "我为你的订婚祝贺。", "shortMeaning": "恭喜你订婚。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:a9546808-3423-48c9-9184-22c366b949ee", "text": "我为她翻译了好几次这个词。", "shortMeaning": "这个词我替她译过好几回。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:47fb2fd4-6a10-417d-bfef-49ded8d3bba8", "text": "我为您的行为感到可耻。", "shortMeaning": "您的做法让我觉得丢脸。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:72f5c416-62e1-405f-8f38-621a661337ae", "text": "我为我父亲而自豪。", "shortMeaning": "我替父亲骄傲。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:04c8bb20-022d-42c0-9428-3d795c0a1a64", "text": "我为我的兄弟感到自豪。", "shortMeaning": "我兄弟让我自豪。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:74e64f47-11cb-4e0d-a76b-c67794b4a3f6", "text": "我为自己买了副羽毛球拍，但忘记买羽毛球了。", "shortMeaning": "我给自己买了羽毛球拍，却忘了买球。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:cba2b07e-0a2b-4620-806e-473f53e7b344", "text": "我为自己的错误自怨自艾。", "shortMeaning": "我老怨自己犯的错。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:d19c4465-405b-4326-9a42-d79807f826e4", "text": "我为这个错误负责。", "shortMeaning": "这个错我担着。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:b9a69463-80f8-4259-9e98-ae7d2a0e3216", "text": "我举办了一场派对。", "shortMeaning": "我办了一场聚会。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:15004555-a844-48f0-81df-f294ad7dd50b", "text": "我举起手拦出租车。", "shortMeaning": "我抬手叫出租车。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:19be3f63-a97c-4170-9d9d-712f166bc6aa", "text": "我之前不怎么想去滑雪。", "shortMeaning": "先前我不太想去滑雪。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:98eaf3e2-db59-4cb4-af0b-4e2e8c33457d", "text": "我之前从未到过那儿。", "shortMeaning": "那地方我以前没去过。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:a0a3af69-27f9-4681-a0bb-15be4c6bae0f", "text": "我之前做的识字卡不知道丢哪了。", "shortMeaning": "我做的字卡不知丢哪儿了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:b298e362-b5f2-4b36-ae67-55cecddb9706", "text": "我之前在哪里听过那段旋律。", "shortMeaning": "那段曲子我以前在哪儿听过。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:c9b00bb2-c386-43aa-8007-224d7c83c951", "text": "我之前在哪里闻到过这个味道。", "shortMeaning": "这味儿我好像在哪儿闻过。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:b83b39ac-e832-4968-b960-2cc1dafe3809", "text": "我之前就告诉过你。", "shortMeaning": "这事我早先就跟你说了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:22a6a984-1c14-4d27-8abe-caab6a2f77dd", "text": "我之前已经来过这里了。", "shortMeaning": "这儿我以前来过。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:804b5221-cb9d-4a18-b062-5a7ebbd58378", "text": "我之前没跟你说过吗？", "shortMeaning": "我不是早跟你说过吗？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:d27c4a58-1b8e-45dc-9ac6-f3315822dc8d", "text": "我之前看过这部电影的。", "shortMeaning": "这片子我以前看过。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:48a4924e-28e5-40bf-8ac1-c7b99e86ac05", "text": "我之前跟你说过，那个你必须自己做。", "shortMeaning": "我说过，那个你得自己弄。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:b899df82-d0a4-43e1-8f5c-738608dece77", "text": "我之后再也没见过他。", "shortMeaning": "打那以后我就没再见过他。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:69300d34-4911-4f38-8a14-02c33cbe866a", "text": "我乘几路车去怀基基？", "shortMeaning": "去怀基基坐几路车？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:dbcf61d6-d14f-4985-8fa1-d4a4970c84de", "text": "我九月份就十六岁了。", "shortMeaning": "九月我就满十六。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:0e819d8d-b560-46f7-a088-fe9f72c6282e", "text": "我也不知道为什么聚会会延期。", "shortMeaning": "聚会为什么推后，我也不清楚。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:444c7ee8-67be-4b93-90aa-987e062f9e8a", "text": "我也不知道为什么聚会被推迟了。", "shortMeaning": "聚会怎么推迟了，我也说不上。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:4ec6c393-fd45-4695-a02c-9123721eb85d", "text": "我也听过一个类似的故事。", "shortMeaning": "差不多的事我也听过一回。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:d9cc2d85-d784-48d4-92ca-57e1efb57e7f", "text": "我也和你想的一样。", "shortMeaning": "我跟你想到一处去了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:f78ae692-2d69-47fa-ad6b-dc5eeda2e620", "text": "我也很想要学法语。", "shortMeaning": "我也想学法语。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:1804e8ad-b843-488b-8466-2e32eb74a588", "text": "我也想要和你身上那件同样的外套。", "shortMeaning": "我也想要一件你身上那样的外套。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:9064ef3a-36a2-4118-ab09-09ce19cd8c8f", "text": "我也是从农村出来的，对贫困有着切身感受。", "shortMeaning": "我也是农村出来的，穷是什么滋味我懂。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:c61942bb-ffd2-4f78-94df-2d310fe705c7", "text": "我也是其中一个忠实的观众。", "shortMeaning": "我也是老看它的一个观众。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:c3c93efa-d3b9-4f73-b5d6-5bbe12c0f9ce", "text": "我也有一样的感觉。", "shortMeaning": "我也有相同的感觉。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:94f2fe68-be4a-491a-a20d-05f074196eb0", "text": "我也没想到我会在这里。", "shortMeaning": "我也没料到自己会到这儿。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:abb21f67-dcea-402d-9f52-372ebec52d02", "text": "我也没有救任何人。", "shortMeaning": "我一个也没救下。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:24e534b4-5cf3-4106-917f-12db89654a1e", "text": "我也碰到过和你一样的问题。", "shortMeaning": "你遇的这问题我也碰到过。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:29c5b9c4-df3f-4017-b3f6-0c6bff16a328", "text": "我也管理自己的网站，试试记录我的进步而且给别人帮助。", "shortMeaning": "我也有自己的网站，记下长进，也帮着别人。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:88ac8682-02e4-43a3-8370-c504169cc8e9", "text": "我也许不会反对他去。", "shortMeaning": "他去，我也许不反对。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:7d845ec4-3fc1-4cde-b88c-57abe270f35e", "text": "我也许得尝试写更多东西了。", "shortMeaning": "我也许该多写点东西了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:e9e4c0d4-3491-446b-822d-787f3f43c99d", "text": "我买不起300块美元以上的照相机。", "shortMeaning": "三百美金以上的相机我买不起。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:7f58d027-136e-44f2-af7b-67670c23d14b", "text": "我买不起这么贵的轿车。", "shortMeaning": "这么贵的轿车我买不起。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:74a6ecd5-474d-49dc-84d6-f05eb967f68e", "text": "我买不起这辆车，它太贵了。", "shortMeaning": "这车太贵，我买不了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:9df9df01-3863-4b47-b2a4-0a19832aceac", "text": "我买了一包冰冻玉米。", "shortMeaning": "我买了一袋冻玉米。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:9f574c81-54e9-45aa-ba77-f9abc25683a7", "text": "我买了一台烘洗一体机。", "shortMeaning": "我买了台洗烘一体的机器。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:9a73d3aa-3345-40ab-91c1-648248d9b51f", "text": "我买了一套新的音响。", "shortMeaning": "我买了一套新音响。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:5cf8d951-4205-40e0-b9b8-fb3e067b9e0d", "text": "我买了一支钢笔，但我把它丢了。", "shortMeaning": "我买了支钢笔，后来丢了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:3fdfa8fa-9515-4c4b-81cf-45ecfde293f1", "text": "我买了一本关于动物的书。", "shortMeaning": "我买了一本讲动物的书。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:8849df9c-ae59-4eb9-9fa7-0891a7d82ede", "text": "我买了一盏古老的灯。", "shortMeaning": "我买了盏很旧的灯。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:71b6d481-f579-4c33-8488-1273febe2a75", "text": "我买了一盏很旧的灯。", "shortMeaning": "我买来一盏旧灯。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:ca1fe67b-8253-41b3-b348-2ac280b5a765", "text": "我买了一辆电动自行车。", "shortMeaning": "我买了辆电动车。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:e4222678-96fc-41bc-80ba-71190b48e83b", "text": "我买了两件棉质衬衫。", "shortMeaning": "我买了两件棉布衬衫。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:e63ea8e5-65be-4d3b-bfce-baa484a7d028", "text": "我买了两张音乐会的票。", "shortMeaning": "我买了两张音乐会门票。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:653364fa-471d-48db-9b8f-12037d45695f", "text": "我买了两朵漂亮的花。", "shortMeaning": "我买了两朵好看的花。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:6d6d11ee-eb38-413f-b74d-185aa82bbddc", "text": "我买了二十四支铅笔。", "shortMeaning": "铅笔我买了二十四支。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:8893e127-bc22-4d0c-a3a5-be293073dcf4", "text": "我买了他一条领带。", "shortMeaning": "我给他买了条领带。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:3d7b550c-adeb-4ae5-bcb6-0fcd8e43a858", "text": "我买了份英文写的报纸。", "shortMeaning": "我买了份英文报。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:23bb2a48-28d5-4f1a-afbf-96e70b65857e", "text": "我买了台新电视机。", "shortMeaning": "我买了台新电视。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:2be10aac-978f-47f5-8657-cd54ed8f3b7d", "text": "我买了很多笔记本。", "shortMeaning": "我买了不少本子。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:78c768fd-dcdb-47ad-acc4-f100d1e996e2", "text": "我买了菜，做好了饭，等我儿子来吃饭。", "shortMeaning": "我买好菜做好饭，等儿子回来吃。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:0d9be7ba-ccdf-4142-926d-3a9192f5f545", "text": "我买了辆电动汽车。", "shortMeaning": "我买了辆电动小汽车。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:9180f4e0-5636-405d-8c7b-d194e11725c1", "text": "我买了这双鞋，但是有点太小了。", "shortMeaning": "这双鞋我买了，就是有点小。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:91ca88a1-f5a5-43ef-9cab-1c051bfe4591", "text": "我买了那些小孩需要的书。", "shortMeaning": "孩子们要的书我买齐了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:5e2c8cc3-c0cd-42bc-b2a6-0445bc27bbc5", "text": "我买到了一辆新摩托车。", "shortMeaning": "我弄到一辆新摩托。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:41f04040-4a1e-49dc-809d-b5efa7b9b0b8", "text": "我买好了徐家汇附近的高层。", "shortMeaning": "我在徐家汇附近买了套高层房。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:83156c2b-809e-4066-9f3f-74f2640d023a", "text": "我买好了，两盒西洋参，五斤苹果，还有十只蟹带去。", "shortMeaning": "我都买好了：两盒西洋参、五斤苹果、十只蟹，一并带去。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:5d1b1b6a-90df-43cc-99d4-92e01d96f46e", "text": "我买房子有两年了。", "shortMeaning": "我买房已经两年。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:3aa4105c-b11f-434f-aa39-77867663d2a2", "text": "我了解了很多希腊的文化。", "shortMeaning": "我对希腊文化知道得不少了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:8845663c-541f-4e3c-a322-44dfd8694c27", "text": "我了解的情况是看韩剧者基本上是一些无所事事的女人。", "shortMeaning": "我了解到，看韩剧的多是些闲着的女人。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:f508a79f-f947-4d06-8fdd-9a0124a97f8f", "text": "我于1977年3月5号在大阪出生。", "shortMeaning": "一九七七年三月五日我生在大阪。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:df0fd824-7005-4c3d-a510-bf5fb839e183", "text": "我五年前做了网膜剥离。", "shortMeaning": "五年前我做过视网膜剥离手术。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:ae60ac83-12ab-43a8-9e01-936c604b61e2", "text": "我五点到你家来接你。", "shortMeaning": "五点我到你家接你。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:cf6328e1-306b-483b-9ac3-9d6515ee654f", "text": "我人生中第一次游览了罗马。", "shortMeaning": "我这辈子头一回逛了罗马。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:46ee56bc-7473-4143-9305-cb559f94c0e3", "text": "我什么也没有告诉你。", "shortMeaning": "我什么都没跟你说。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:12745acf-9625-4822-969d-9859e2ba7553", "text": "我什么事都没有做。", "shortMeaning": "我什么事也没干。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:00fbf847-47a3-4aba-9fd6-d96045228d11", "text": "我什么时候到达东京？", "shortMeaning": "我几时能到东京？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:9c29143a-5704-494d-aa55-9eaf3cd96f61", "text": "我什么时候能再看到你？", "shortMeaning": "我哪时能再见你？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:236fb7bf-87a5-49a8-9128-8f54ab4c9e6c", "text": "我什么经验都没有。", "shortMeaning": "我一点经验也没有。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:c0d26de8-d799-47ec-86f7-a89f689038c0", "text": "我什么都不说了，这使得他更为恼怒。", "shortMeaning": "我一句都不说了，他反倒更恼。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:9f84f2aa-1633-4f7b-b3c3-6d17abc9d7cc", "text": "我什么都没能看见。", "shortMeaning": "我什么都没看见。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:e55bcd6f-2b39-4075-9347-82560382c3f4", "text": "我今天不想学习英语。", "shortMeaning": "今天我不想学英语。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:81270a6a-84a9-4ded-9be0-16f3bdb10da0", "text": "我今天在学校被嘲笑了。", "shortMeaning": "今天在学校我被人笑话了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:c342f68e-efba-4f60-a6a4-378b49148e85", "text": "我今天感冒了，声音和平时有点不一样。", "shortMeaning": "我今天感冒，声音跟平常不太一样。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:935597b3-a625-405a-baf5-df2cd61dc55a", "text": "我今天早上不想散步。", "shortMeaning": "今早我不想去散步。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:cffcb788-c1e1-4bf1-8120-390200710cd9", "text": "我今天早上喝了一杯牛奶。", "shortMeaning": "今早我喝了一杯奶。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:a1de71bf-12dd-426c-8a5e-93889348d824", "text": "我今天早上错过了公交车。", "shortMeaning": "今早我误了公交车。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:a087d72d-fcb1-4671-b62e-8e1c9eb521b5", "text": "我今天碰上你很高兴。", "shortMeaning": "今天遇上你，我挺高兴。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:4d169ba7-431c-45d0-ab87-e86848782d4d", "text": "我今天要准备晚饭。", "shortMeaning": "今天晚饭得我来做。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:6b1a6bc1-bc73-4a81-97e9-28fb55b92287", "text": "我今天要早点回家。", "shortMeaning": "今天我要早些回去。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:9be59c3d-e79c-4b38-a059-7dbc8bf34953", "text": "我今年去了好几次外国。", "shortMeaning": "今年我出了好几趟国。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:e5c5cc80-cba2-4ba0-a25a-44884ab9850b", "text": "我今早起床时，我爸已经吃过早饭了。", "shortMeaning": "我今早起来时，我爸吃过早饭了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:19a2eb13-30a8-4ff5-82bc-f3109ce068cc", "text": "我今晚10点见你比较方便。", "shortMeaning": "我今晚十点见你方便些。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:11153232-0b1b-4c7f-870f-864bc9ec951c", "text": "我今晚不准备出去玩，我要预备功课。", "shortMeaning": "今晚我不出去玩，要复习功课。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:ef17fd72-f39c-417f-a4d9-ca64041b0941", "text": "我今晚六点之前都有空。", "shortMeaning": "今晚六点以前我都有空。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:dffdf77d-d3c4-4fc1-891a-87e19a6cdfe8", "text": "我今晚可以借一下你的车吗？", "shortMeaning": "今晚能借你的车用用吗？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:09947b74-c020-4e83-b9d5-63fda2161d39", "text": "我今晚想吃些批萨。", "shortMeaning": "今晚我想吃比萨。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:95e8d80d-5e66-4dda-8400-a063f71b08b0", "text": "我今晚给你打电话。", "shortMeaning": "今晚我给你打电话。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:402271b7-be6b-41ee-bd17-bda80b541a5b", "text": "我今晚能借你的数码相机吗？", "shortMeaning": "今晚你的数码相机能借我用吗？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:45ab022a-ab79-496e-834d-92841a070e71", "text": "我今晨看见一位天使。", "shortMeaning": "今早我看见一个天使。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:bfeb054a-6d39-4268-994b-b8d26c68eed0", "text": "我仍旧无法相信我居然做了这种事。", "shortMeaning": "我还是不信自己会干出这种事。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:c4ba6d08-777b-42d5-aa48-f8be378c56de", "text": "我仍然热爱着网球运动。", "shortMeaning": "我还是很喜欢打网球。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:2a47a686-4d8e-4668-98c5-b8a4b5fdb910", "text": "我仍然记得他的名字。", "shortMeaning": "他的名字我还记得。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:7775640b-7306-4729-ac2b-ba86e7f2628b", "text": "我仍然需要一个答案。", "shortMeaning": "我还得要个答复。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:7df8226a-2706-4a31-8930-ad21556b8568", "text": "我从一个大家庭来。", "shortMeaning": "我出自一个大家庭。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:858c9eca-5c3b-4d4d-ae5b-779954e5f1d8", "text": "我从一开始就知道他在说谎。", "shortMeaning": "我一开始就知道他在说假话。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:8dc54b1a-b8ba-4952-980e-2eb2315931db", "text": "我从一开始就错了。", "shortMeaning": "我一开头就错了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:bc7f011f-d0c8-4d54-9b34-08e5c7be8398", "text": "我从不回复陌生人发来的电子邮件。", "shortMeaning": "生人发来的邮件我一概不回。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:18876ccd-9648-40e2-9a1b-4065baa30bc6", "text": "我从今早就开始等他了。", "shortMeaning": "我从今天早上就等着他。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:cfd166de-ddd0-48c6-9637-3dc555094691", "text": "我从今晚开始做起。", "shortMeaning": "我今晚就动手做起。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:f66e5b0c-b627-4f76-891b-b14032316b84", "text": "我从他那里买了它。", "shortMeaning": "我是从他手上买的。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:c7a0ee75-b462-427d-8a7a-aeedd737d86b", "text": "我从你的表情猜到你有好消息。", "shortMeaning": "看你的神情，我猜你有好消息。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:01e2eecf-0973-4e1d-b89e-08bb22b30929", "text": "我从你身上学了很多。", "shortMeaning": "我跟你学了不少。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:cfea348d-44e4-49d4-90ef-0e5e7847945c", "text": "我从南安普顿乘船去了纽约。", "shortMeaning": "我从南安普顿坐船到纽约。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:4b77fd2b-f820-4c9e-82f9-5af9ae84b5a4", "text": "我从她那里拿了一根自动铅笔芯。", "shortMeaning": "我跟她要了一根铅笔芯。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:784a3d9e-11bc-44d3-8ab1-69e82e5a1679", "text": "我从小就梦想着做一名糕点师。", "shortMeaning": "我小时候就想着当糕点师。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:4b0fd88b-4861-4443-97f6-37d92a3bd852", "text": "我从小的梦想就是做一名糕点师。", "shortMeaning": "我打小的心愿就是当糕点师。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:1b66e359-ed84-454a-82dc-f249c716c0a2", "text": "我从意大利来了，我会说意大利语。", "shortMeaning": "我从意大利来，会说意大利语。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:c82daad6-f3a3-4082-b2ef-49bc1f9264a2", "text": "我从我的错误里学到了这么多，现在我想再犯几个错！", "shortMeaning": "我从错误里学到了这么多，现在还想再错几回！", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:5ac39428-2d99-42b8-934f-af3183b59dcf", "text": "我从早到晚都想念你。", "shortMeaning": "我从早到晚都惦记你。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:05e803ca-1c21-4c7e-b30b-03d1c32f6b51", "text": "我从未后悔与你结婚。", "shortMeaning": "跟你结婚，我从没后悔。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:c4f116ac-1a8e-4204-bab0-0fc6abb49508", "text": "我从未想过我居然会得这个奖。", "shortMeaning": "我从没想过自己能得这个奖。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:4fd48cad-03d0-404c-b1d1-34cc6ec5bb78", "text": "我从来不后悔帮过他。", "shortMeaning": "帮他的事我从没后悔。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:1ce05f2a-8011-4ece-b46c-a63e49b9f97e", "text": "我从来不认为安逸和享乐是人生本来的目的。", "shortMeaning": "我从没觉得舒服享乐是活着的目的。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:06dc612d-706d-41ab-b053-cf5ce51500db", "text": "我从来没去过美国。", "shortMeaning": "美国我从没去过。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:65da64d1-0a22-4593-a426-8e9346f78b9c", "text": "我从来没去过美洲。", "shortMeaning": "美洲我一次也没去过。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:15904e80-7d76-4cf3-b9f8-fb00fe2db369", "text": "我从来没吃过中国菜。", "shortMeaning": "中国菜我一口都没吃过。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:8a339109-fdeb-40c8-bc0f-d543e4a33968", "text": "我从来没听过她说‘不’。", "shortMeaning": "我从没听她说过一个“不”字。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:11a6cee1-0856-434b-9603-dfb5b3c0403e", "text": "我从来没想到他能做到那么残忍的事。", "shortMeaning": "我从没料到他会那么狠。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:cc35438b-1c6d-473f-be3b-1b84195f8f91", "text": "我从来没想到会发生那种事。", "shortMeaning": "我从没想到会出那种事。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:ca696fdc-e0ed-4176-af61-2d01487e164d", "text": "我从来没感觉那么好过。", "shortMeaning": "我从没有过这么好的感觉。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:07e5ea5e-93ed-4c06-983f-40c17638a362", "text": "我从来没有相信过战争是好的。", "shortMeaning": "我从没信过打仗是好事。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:42abff20-7bf0-4416-88a1-510b1c3364c0", "text": "我从来没有看到她笑过。", "shortMeaning": "我从没见她笑过。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:51604675-cd18-4aaa-a103-c02604c16d59", "text": "我从来没有见过谁像你这么虚伪的。", "shortMeaning": "我没见过比你更假的人。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:aec9ad71-18b1-4b38-8d70-917ed97f5df9", "text": "我从来没看过那么漂亮的东西。", "shortMeaning": "这么好看的东西我从没见过。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:163e9de8-eeb6-411b-b0b7-28f9b66da21b", "text": "我从来没碰到过这么倔的人。", "shortMeaning": "这么犟的人我没碰见过。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:c3785032-987f-426c-809e-a8aa5ddfb580", "text": "我从来没见过那么大一条鲸。", "shortMeaning": "那么大的鲸我从没见过。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:f4b91336-8d9d-4a75-9872-fba2887915e9", "text": "我从来没说过我很脆弱。", "shortMeaning": "我从没说过自己脆弱。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:bbecf51f-fe34-4961-9342-ab778562309d", "text": "我从来没说过我是专家。", "shortMeaning": "我从没自夸是行家。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:79b7d7cd-5011-4c4b-bce6-f1eb93d514b6", "text": "我从来没读过这么闷的书。", "shortMeaning": "这么闷的书我没读过。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:d94a192a-97b3-4773-b5a7-4344871a9115", "text": "我从没吃过活的章鱼。", "shortMeaning": "活章鱼我从来没吃过。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:faf9bb33-cf30-43b3-b540-95762547cca0", "text": "我从没听见他唱过歌。", "shortMeaning": "我从没听过他唱歌。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:e0b703d1-5496-4b25-aefd-58ac7cc96590", "text": "我从没听说他关于其他人说坏话。", "shortMeaning": "我没听说他讲过别人坏话。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:f445fc26-84de-496c-b9a6-e662eb6b2224", "text": "我从没听说过这个演员。", "shortMeaning": "这个演员我没听说过。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:ecce6a6b-f37a-439d-81ec-ea3eb6d239eb", "text": "我从没听说过这件事。", "shortMeaning": "这事我没听过。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:2daf5f82-cdfa-4c15-bc6d-1ba55b8da0d0", "text": "我从没听过她说别人坏话。", "shortMeaning": "我没听她说过别人的不是。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:38de595b-b3a1-4f0d-bc5f-dad4303256e9", "text": "我从没想到事情会变成这样。", "shortMeaning": "我没想到事情成了这样。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:399b51ee-e954-4be6-a87a-638cafd57b69", "text": "我从没想到我会得头奖。", "shortMeaning": "我没料到会中头奖。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:326a1fed-f67a-422e-9d3d-51536befef5a", "text": "我从没想过它会变成这样。", "shortMeaning": "我没想过它会成这样。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:b36d921d-28e1-473b-8d94-4db5a746c808", "text": "我从没想过（我）能够被（选用/接受/采用）。", "shortMeaning": "我从没想过自己会被选上。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:d033b9c4-f19a-485f-a53f-aa1d3455a677", "text": "我从没有爬过这座山。", "shortMeaning": "这座山我没爬过。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:b34a44a9-1a10-4c5b-9e35-9f5a0643e7fd", "text": "我从没看见过她笑。", "shortMeaning": "我没见过她笑。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:1007612d-c478-44a9-bc6a-cb8f9774111f", "text": "我从没看过一个那么漂亮的日落。", "shortMeaning": "那么美的日落我没见过。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:e77291ed-6014-47d7-a9c7-59ac7cb88f39", "text": "我从没见过一条那么大的鲸鱼。", "shortMeaning": "我还没见过那么大的鲸鱼。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:bf41cdc3-75b3-4d09-83a2-f2e843882b9b", "text": "我从没见过像这样的东西。", "shortMeaning": "这样的东西我没见过。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:4af22407-b0b6-47fd-adf0-17aa5c37670e", "text": "我从没见过红色的冰箱。", "shortMeaning": "红色的冰箱我没见过。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:c1ab2648-44b4-47ff-9354-07afd3a2dbf6", "text": "我从没见过胖的纯素食者。", "shortMeaning": "我没见过胖的纯素者。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:a2d04a84-58b4-4b80-85ee-72f0972ff13e", "text": "我从没见过那么壮丽的日落景色。", "shortMeaning": "那么壮阔的落日我没看过。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:94c7163e-154b-43fb-aeb1-dc627d431825", "text": "我从没见过那么多钱。", "shortMeaning": "那么多钱我没见过。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:27968c7e-513c-4727-b752-0fa8da5abfc6", "text": "我从没见过那么大的西瓜！", "shortMeaning": "那么大的西瓜我没见过！", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
